# Generated by `baml agent install`, which writes the same reference twice on
# purpose: `.claude/` is read by Claude Code and `.agents/` by Codex / OpenCode,
# and this repository's review gate is Codex, so both are load-bearing.
#
# Ignored for the reason `baml_sdk/` is. Prettier reformats markdown it did not
# write -- `*emphasis*` to `_emphasis_`, collapsing ``double-backtick`` spans --
# so a formatted copy differs from generator output on ~15 lines that mean
# nothing. That made refreshing the skill impossible to read: every `baml agent
# install` came back dirty, and a real upstream change was indistinguishable
# from prettier's churn. Only `baml-core/` is generated; the hand-written skills
# beside it are still formatted.
